{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>What Nachtmahr is:</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nachtmahr is exploration.\u00a0 It is discovery.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nachtmahr is a puzzle to be solved.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nachtmahr is a serene experience\u2026a walk in the woods on a quiet day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nachtmahr allows players to poke around the entire world.\u00a0 The player seeks out the puzzles to solve.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nachtmahr is an adventure at a different pace.\u00a0 The player decides how to explore the world and what to do.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nachtmahr is about thinking, decision-making, trial and error, and experimentation. Players need to engage their brain.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>What Nachtmahr is not:</strong></i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nachtmahr is not about a score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nachtmahr is NOT a shoot \u2018em up with nonstop action onslaught.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nachtmahr is not a game that spoonfeeds the player.\u00a0 Players have to work for it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nachtmahr is not a game where the best button-smasher beats it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nachtmahr is not a game where the players blindly follow the bread crumb trail to deliver them to every destination.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900740/extras/a28060a2d28c439abc4660c0e27ed21f.poster.avif?t=1759865306\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900740/extras/a28060a2d28c439abc4660c0e27ed21f.webm?t=1759865306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900740/extras/a28060a2d28c439abc4660c0e27ed21f.mp4?t=1759865306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>&quot;Nachtmahr&quot; is a single-player, third-person adventure where you become a mythical unicorn bound by magic and mystery. Experience five breathtaking realms\u2014each with its own haunting beauty, original soundtrack, and secrets waiting to be unraveled.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900740/extras/2b66297eb9b2816621b8b2069fc9d990.poster.avif?t=1759865306\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900740/extras/2b66297eb9b2816621b8b2069fc9d990.webm?t=1759865306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900740/extras/2b66297eb9b2816621b8b2069fc9d990.mp4?t=1759865306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Solve ancient puzzles, uncover lost memories, and collect fragments of a forgotten past as you awaken the poetic story hidden deep within the world.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900740/extras/6fd6404aeca65f4cfa39f3e587ac5e1b.poster.avif?t=1759865306\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900740/extras/6fd6404aeca65f4cfa39f3e587ac5e1b.webm?t=1759865306\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900740/extras/6fd6404aeca65f4cfa39f3e587ac5e1b.mp4?t=1759865306\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In Nachtmahr, every step reveals wonder\u2026and ev